<title>FINLAND: KONECRANES JAN-AUG PROFIT SOARS.</title>
<headline>KONECRANES JAN-AUG PROFIT SOARS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		   91.9 vs 53.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    4.07 vs 2.22</p>
<p> Net sales				 1,453.0 vs 1,333.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast profit after financial</p>
<p>items was 90 million markka (mean 91 million) in a 81 to 106</p>
<p>million markka range.</p>
<p>Share of profits of</p>
<p> associated companies		 gain 0.3 vs 4.5 charge</p>
<p> Depreciation				 35.4 vs 35.3</p>
<p> Operating profit			   92.1 vs 57.4</p>
<p> Interest income and expenses   charge 0.8 vs 4.4 charge</p>
<p> Other financial items		gain 0.6 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations,taxes   91.9 vs 53.0</p>
<p> Taxes					  30.9 vs 19.8</p>
<p> Net profit				   61.0 vs 33.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish crane maker is KCI-Konecranes</p>
<p>Oy. -- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0248</p>
</text>
